## Part 2 — Patient Journey Portal

### 2.1 Who Uses It
Patients themselves. Role: `PATIENT`. They log into `/portal` from any device (mobile-first).

### 2.2 Login Flow (Patient)
- Existing login page handles this — just needs role-aware redirect (see §1.2)
- Patient portal also supports **passwordless / OTP / magic-link** (stub already in `PatientPortal.tsx`)
- The existing stub at `/portal` is just a sign-in screen — needs replacing with a full portal shell

### 2.3 Patient Shell (Layout)
New file: `components/patient/PatientShell.tsx`

- Mobile-first bottom nav (Home, Timeline, Appointments, Documents, Billing)
- Top bar: Patient name, MRN, attending doctor name
- Clean white + teal color scheme (already started in existing stub)

### 2.4 Patient Routes to Build

```
/portal                         → Login / OTP (existing stub)
/portal/home                    → Dashboard summary card
/portal/timeline                → Full care journey timeline
/portal/timeline/assessment     → View initial assessment
/portal/timeline/vitals         → View vitals history (read-only)
/portal/timeline/orders         → View medication & test orders
/portal/timeline/notes          → View doctor notes (read-only)
/portal/timeline/discharge      → View discharge summary
/portal/appointments            → Appointments list + upcoming
/portal/appointments/[id]       → Appointment detail
/portal/documents               → Lab results, reports, prescriptions
/portal/billing                 → Bill summary + itemized breakdown
/portal/billing/payment         → Payment gateway integration
/portal/insurance               → Insurance claim status
/portal/insurance/[claimId]     → Claim detail + document upload
/portal/profile                 → Patient profile + emergency contacts
```

### 2.5 Patient Pages — Feature Detail

#### Home Dashboard (`/portal/home`)
- Welcome banner with patient name and admission status
- Quick-action cards: View Timeline, Next Appointment, Outstanding Bill, Message Doctor
- Current care team card (attending doctor, nurse, ward)
- Health alerts / notifications from clinical team

#### Care Timeline (`/portal/timeline`)
- Chronological vertical timeline from admission to present
- Each event: Initial Assessment, Lab Results, Medication Started, Doctor Visit, Procedure
- Tap each event to expand detail view
- Status: Completed ✅ / Pending ⏳ / Requires Action ⚠️

#### Vitals View (`/portal/timeline/vitals`)
- Read-only chart of all recorded vitals
- Last reading prominently displayed with color-coded status (normal/abnormal)

#### Orders View (`/portal/timeline/orders`)
- List of prescribed medications with dosage, schedule, next dose
- Pending lab tests with "Sample collected / Results awaited" status
- Imaging results with preview thumbnail

#### Appointments (`/portal/appointments`)
- Upcoming: date, time, doctor, department, location, "Add to Calendar" button
- Past appointments with visit summary link
- Reschedule / cancel flow (if within policy window)

#### Documents (`/portal/documents`)
- Lab reports, imaging reports, prescriptions, discharge letter
- Download as PDF
- Uploaded documents from insurance section also appear here

#### Billing (`/portal/billing`)
- Total outstanding balance
- Itemized table: Consultation, Procedures, Medications, Room Charges, Investigations
- Payment history
- "Pay Now" CTA → payment gateway (Stripe/Razorpay integration)

#### Insurance (`/portal/insurance`)
- Active insurance policy summary (provider, policy number, coverage)
- Claim status: Initiated → Documents Submitted → Under Review → Approved/Rejected
- Upload supporting documents
- Pre-authorization tracking

